WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.150
A list holds many values, and a loop draws one bar for each

2
00:00:04.905 --> 00:00:09.455
An array is a list in square brackets. The first item is number 0.

3
00:00:10.701 --> 00:00:14.476
A for loop counts i from 0 up to the length of the list.

4
00:00:20.065 --> 00:00:24.790
heights of i is each value in turn, so four values draw four bars.
